# @mirror/store persistent state (crystals-in-the-store-DAG). N3 TICK 1
# lands `.mirror/action_cache/<spec_oid>/<target_oid>/<inputs_oid>/verdict.json`
# as the verdict-cache surface (`shards/mirror/store/action_cache.mirror`);
# future ticks add more crystal shapes under `.mirror/`. Untracked by
# design — the persistence is per-workspace, not per-commit.
.mirror/
